## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical edge deployment, OTA rollout, and telemetry-driven governance for real-world industrial settings.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Edge Manager OTA workflow
- Canary and phased rollouts with rollback triggers
- Telemetry-driven monitoring (latency, errors, drift)
- Edge manifest versioning and cryptographic signing
- Cost governance and access control

## Code Example
```json
{
  "EdgeVersion": "v1.2.3",
  "ModelArtifactsS3Key": "s3://bucket/models/maintenance/v1.2.3/model.tar.gz",
  "SignKMSKeyId": "alias/edge-signing-key",
  "RolloutPlan": {
    "CanaryGroup": {
      "DeviceCount": 100,
      "MonitoringDuration": "24h",
      "ApprovalRequired": true
    },
    "Phases": [
      {
        "Name": "Phase1",
        "DevicePercentage": 10,
        "DeviceTypes": ["high-priority"]
      },
      {
        "Name": "Phase2", 
        "DevicePercentage": 30,
        "DeviceTypes": ["critical-infrastructure"]
      },
      {
        "Name": "Phase3",
        "DevicePercentage": 59,
        "DeviceTypes": ["standard"]
      }
    ]
  },
